  "description": "VB.NET PLANET Barcode Reader on Excel Guide: This package includes VB.NET sample source code to scan, read PLANET barcodes from Excel files using XImage.Barcode Reader library\n\nInput :\n* Raster images: bitmap (.bmp), gif, png, jpeg/jpg\n* Document formats: PDF, multi-page TIFF, Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx), PowerPoint (.pptx)\n* Stream objects or binary data\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Guides :\n* Developer Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/vb-net-imaging/read-barcode-vb-net/\n* Support : support@rasteredge.com",
